;    1: TDecorate(count=723, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=417, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=は, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=21, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おきて, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1426, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1278, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\川辺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> did nothing but watch the flow of the river.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I followed his lead and watched the flow of the river too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, did you know? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　A river flows like this, and you can't go against its flow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But the river joins the sea, and then it flows on toward unknown lands. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Nature is very free. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Rain and wind often bring disaster on people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But from nature's point of view, that's only because it moved freely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Unswayed by human will or custom, it always acts as it pleases, freely."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Human beings can't live going against nature. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Before nature's freedom, people are powerless. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> turned those eyes of his to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But it's precisely in the midst of it that human beings can live strongly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Human beings have always suffered before nature's freedom and harshness. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But at the same time, we're kept alive by nature's bounty. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We live within nature. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's why I think human beings, too, should be freer."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nature is humanity's teacher. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We are taught by nature, we learn from nature, and we live together with nature. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Wanting to learn, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="は">sending</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> your dreams out toward the future. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Isn't having that freedom taken away the same as going against nature?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I want you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, to live more freely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To let something like custom crush the passion and dreams you were born with... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Don't you think that, of all things, is wicked?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Is it? I don't really know..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If you don't mind my asking... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What sort of person is the one you're marrying?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't know him. I'm to meet him for the first time on the day of the wedding."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's custom. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Marrying the person your parents chose is a normal thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="4">But don't you think that's wrong!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A shout from <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE>, so loud the sound of the river fell away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My eyes and my ears were wholly taken by <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Marriage... is that what it is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry... for butting into something like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> turned his eyes to the river again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what is it you wish for?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What I wish for...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, how do you want to live?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Is there any meaning in wishing for a way to live?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> declared it flatly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If you give up, there's no more hope and no more future. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if you don't give up, then surely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that's not right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Dreaming is certainly important. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But what's more important is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">taking action to make the dream come true."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Dreaming is something anyone can do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But without effort or action, in the end it's just a pipe dream. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">All I can do now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">is live inside that pipe dream. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">On my own, there's nothing I can do about it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what do you think? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　What do you think I should do, to keep chasing my dream?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you are irresponsible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Nothing but ideals, without even knowing what I should do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This is the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おきて">law</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> of this age and this place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">By my will alone, I can't do anything about it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Then...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> stood up and looked down at me.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Then come to the Arata settlement."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------